    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08359f2ed95d355fd1cf379",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——受此影响，她无法参加『樱花赏』前预定的\n赛事，加上未能调整好出战『樱花赏』\n的竞技状态，因此只能选择放弃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe98064d1638402fec201ecb74f3f0f9278afdef6b60d0bef020dab8d727130",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
