    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b68a9139d763750f36d8186",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她决定将目标调整至『橡树大赛』，\n转而参加其前哨战——\n『勿忘草锦标』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd4df0712a74e5763045a7fe4c7da97a7753bf8e873a0dce00fd6782a8a25ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
